{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>תחסר</b> — three times in the Masorah: here, and <b>וצפחת השמן לא תחסר</b>, and <b>ובטן רשעים תחסר</b>. Even though this is said of the Land of Israel, the righteous everywhere will not lack bread — for Elijah went to Zarephath and there said to her <b>לא תחסר</b>; but the wicked everywhere will lack." "<b> לא תחסר</b> — tagin on the resh, to teach that it is ראש עפרות תבל (the head of the dust of the world)."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {0 "The two other occurrences are 1 Kings 17:14 and Proverbs 13:25."}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:09:11.769139673Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}